wFX2CMr&_nc_gid=WZv0kUxnAmFK6D2ANg2nZw&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afh4eMd9S_Pj8YGDcfx4F6qYJtwFFuEOHc-Ckxqav7Pw6g&oe=69314B70&_nc_sid=d885a2","comment":"Someone says bad things about blacks. It’s allowed. I defend the blacks getting racially abused , I get shadow banned , make it make sense @mosseri . Fix the racism@in instagram . We are fed up.","date_of_comment":"2025-02-06T07:08:34.000Z","likes":null,"num_replies":0,"replies":[],"user_commenting":"in_cognito_j"},{"avatar":"https://scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/485612520_1363327301381492_1202328211737675014_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2QENa5mDbw9OyYDUzsTtUp4rDN3QwhSbIWuLev4zF-i1fCKWg3xCAJH6QCtxUpSe26c&_nc_ohc=SkKd5ARbIYQQ7kNvwH1pjxo&_nc_gid=WZv0kUxnAmFK6D2ANg2nZw&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfhYEjM6AFBF0LglPKadU9EZkl5eMZ3nUvGCMFoYl168oA&oe=6931369D&_nc_sid=d885a2","comment":"❤️❤️❤️","date_of_comment":"2025-01-30T21:37:39.000Z","likes":null,"num_replies":0,"replies":[],"user_commenting":"mhti_eslami"},{"avatar":"https://scontent-dfw5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/456559866_1186118895972700_3481552939888820874_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2QENa5mDbw9OyYDUzsTtUp4rDN3QwhSbIWuLev4zF-i1fCKWg3xCAJH6QCtxUpSe26c&_nc_ohc=zNeNyU1FT3oQ7kNvwEWvBQ0&_nc_gid=WZv0kUxnAmFK6D2ANg2nZw&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Afj_d0cb_0sXE72_0Deg31mzqRNpncuaXN6remSbJN8IrA&oe=693141F3&_nc_sid=d885a2","comment":"the bots don't change general consensus, we want a square option!! GIVE US THE CHOICE OF SQUARE","date_of_comment":"2025-01-20T13:50:55.000Z","likes":null,"num_replies":0,"replies":[],"user_commenting":"_idiotfriend_"},{"avatar":"https://scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/467255009_1228319625058645_593050966329398409_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby4xMDgwLmMyIn0&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2QENa5mDbw9OyYDUzsTtUp4rDN3QwhSbIWuLev4zF-i1fCKWg3xCAJH6QCtxUpSe26c&_nc_ohc=ckwyeGcp_JwQ7kNvwFxfiW5&_nc_gid=WZv0kUxnAmFK6D2ANg2nZw&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AfiZwIFvrxmkiiwDuRr15xv5ovrWgs--vjjB3XpRmxgLOA&oe=6931508E&_nc_sid=d885a2","comment":"Subject: Request to Restore Square Grid Format  Dear Mr. Mosseri and Instagram Team,  I am writing to express my concern about the recent changes to the grid format on Instagram feeds. As a creator, the square grid has been essential to the consistency and professional presentation of my comics. This change has disrupted the aesthetic I’ve carefully built, offering no benefit while causing frustration.  I strongly urge Instagram to restore the original square grid or implement an option that allows creators to choose their preferred format. Flexibility in grid options is critical to supporting the diverse creative needs of your global community and ensuring creators can maintain their unique styles without compromise.  Thank you for your attention and consideration.  Best regards, Diego da Cruz Botelho Creator of DataCoffeeComics  @instagram","date_of_comment":"2025-01-18T16:53:38.000Z","likes":null,"num_replies":0,"replies":[],"user_commenting":"datacoffeecomics"}]

